+
+Date: 2026-10-06
+Status: complete, independent findings fixed; ready to commit after UI5. Root377 engine/81 app tests and Swift build pass using the installed SDK flags.
+
+Ibrahim requested replacement of the menu-bar chain glyph with the selected logo, removal of white margins around B and I.A in current app logo placements, and dark-theme gray glass. Imagegen extracted a transparent signed cutout; light surfaces show it directly, while graphite uses a close-fitting gray glass treatment with a solid reduced-transparency fallback. Menu colors are preserved by a non-template native image, and the decision badge remains present.
